{
  "format": 1,
  "package": "sh",
  "profile": "sh-29.329-sms-opaque-slice-v1",
  "version": "0.1.0-slice.11",
  "sources": [
    "3GPP TS 29.329 V18.0.0 sections 6.1-6.3 and TS 29.328 V18.1.0 sections 6.1.1-6.1.4: Ref24 pull/update, single Ref11/12/25 subscribe/unsubscribe and independent notification",
    "doc/diameterkit-mainflow-audit.md sections 16.2, 20.4; doc/diameterkit-field-inventory.md sections 3.2,4.2,5,6: User-Data is opaque bytes, not XML validation or business acceptance",
    "manual identity revision1: canonical global tel digits or ASCII sip:user@DNS-host; percent escapes retained; no IDNA, URI normalization, password/port/parameters/headers/IPv6 support",
    "manual data revision1: bounded octet preservation only, no XML parser/helper/schema assertion or subscription state; selected UDA success requires UserData AVP, failed UDA/SNA excludes success payload; Time carries raw NTP bits, no era/clock/order judgement",
    "manual subscription revision2: SubsReqType0/1, independent Expiry/SendData presence; SNA optional data is not required by a SHOULD or silently copied; no subscription history, expiry timer or post-unsubscribe PNR suppression",
    "manual feature revision3: TS29.329 section7.1 / TS29.229 section7.2; capture outer M, full responder features, original-request 5011 deficit; bounded ShPeerFeatures context for exact command/requester/responder; mixed Ref11/12/25; no DRA feature inference or subscription state",
    "generator9 / ops8: compiled CheckContext and M-preserving Grouped/Canonical; no transport replay permission",
    "manual context-kind guard revision1: reject nonempty non-Sh evidence even for plain Sh; preserve missing-context fallback for genuinely empty context"
  ],
